        "Content": "3 bedroom semi detached property in a private ‘cul de sac’ development.\r\n1.6 km to Lisdoonvarna or 3 minutes by car.\r\nClose to all amenities and facilities.\r\n2 Solid fuel stoves, one with a back boiler heating water and radiators.\r\nClose to a variety of beaches on the famed ‘Wild Atlantic Way’.\r\nIdeal first time buy.\r\nMature residential development.\r\nVery pivotal to Fanore, Doolin, Lahinch, Liscannor and Ennistymon.\r\nOff street parking.\r\nLow maintenance lawns."
